From: elliotttate <elliotttate@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve owned inputs while combining compatible primitives
Upstream-Commit: d687c6983a404156c540aca9f535c775217852e0

Unpromoted candidate on canonical patches 0152-0162. O3 and ASan each
passed 948 authored fusion checks. Input snapshots and exact boundaries
repair donor ownership hazards; copy costs and combined GPU/native timing
remain unqualified. The draft retains donor default-on behavior: any
production promotion must add an explicit default-off qualification gate.

---
